# --- redirect thirteen -------------------------------------------------------
#
# The one nothing in this repository reveals. /user-story-best-practice/ returns 200
# today and is NOT served from the old site: GitHub Pages serves it from the
# gh-pages branch of the separate awkale/user-story-best-practice repo, which
# resolves under awkale.me only because the user site holds the CNAME. ADR-0001 said
# twelve and missed it entirely, so the cutover would have silently 404'd it.
#
# At 65 stars it is the most externally-validated thing here by a wide margin.
#
# It targets the REPO, not the 2015 slide deck: the deck and the repo's README carry
# the same guide, the README is the better rendering, and the repo is what those
# stars point at. Pointing at awkale.github.io/user-story-best-practice/ was
# rejected as the one target whose behaviour depends on what Pages does once the
# CNAME is removed — an unknown resolved at cutover, on the single URL here with an
# organic audience.

/user-story-best-practice        https://github.com/awkale/user-story-best-practice            301
